**mocka** — MOCK3-1 confirmed. `fareFor` in `src/fares.ts:10` uses `rider.age > 65`, so age exactly 65 falls through to `BASE_FARE_CENTS` (350) instead of `CONCESSION_FARE_CENTS` (175). The comment on line 7 says "65 AND OVER." The test suite covers age 70 but never age 65 exactly.

**mockb** — MOCK3-2 confirmed. `formatStops` in `src/schedule.ts:6` loops `i < stops.length - 1`, skipping the final stop. `totalMinutes` (line 13) correctly reads the last element, so the journey length is right. The test suite checks for `'->'` and `'Union'` but never asserts the last stop appears.

